        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MM2003/24, Modern Series 24\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern 24 Inch Stainless Steel Towel Bar is available in four contemporary finish colors that make it a great choice for chic bathroom remodels. This Modern Series 24 Inch Towel Bar is easy to install and comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. This bath towel bar is made out of stainless steel for long-lasting durability against steamy bathroom environments. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana MM Series\"><b>Deltana MM Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 24 Inch Bathroom Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 23-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 3/8\" x 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette projection: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MM2003-24-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262429\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MM2003/24 24\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
